  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/IMG_6386.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>S&#39;ha fet la nit d&#39;aquest dissabte a un Raval de Sant Josep desbordat de p&uacute;blic, acte de la Societat Art&iacute;stica i Musical Vila d&#39;Onda, presentat per l&#39;ondera televisiva Carme Juan Verdi&agrave;, que ha introdu&iuml;t el personatge d&#39;Esperan&ccedil;a com a fil conductor de les can&ccedil;ons de Disney. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AHyioa8vkuA&amp;t=25s\" target=\"_blank\">Punxeu en aquesta frase en negreta per a veure un v&iacute;deo</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6242.jpg\" alt=\"img_6242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6243.jpg\" alt=\"img_6243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6244.jpg\" alt=\"img_6244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6245.jpg\" alt=\"img_6245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6246.jpg\" alt=\"img_6246\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6247.jpg\" alt=\"img_6247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6248.jpg\" alt=\"img_6248\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertgiselasamvodisney/img_6249.jpg\" alt=\"img_6249\" style=\"max-width: